otherwise.
str05(_):- put_console(c#"*") | str06.

str06:- put_console(key#lf) | wat.

wat:- put_console(ascii#"% Wait %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% ") | wat00.

wat00:- true | wat00(X), unify(X,atom).
wat00(X):- wait(X), put_console(c#"a") | wat01.
otherwise.
wat00(_):- put_console(c#"*") | wat01.

wat01:- true | wat01(X), unify(X,1234).
wat01(X):- wait(X), put_console(c#"b") | wat02.
otherwise.
wat01(_):- put_console(c#"*") | wat02.

wat02:- true | wat02(X), unify(X,12.34).
wat02(X):- wait(X), put_console(c#"c") | wat03.
otherwise.
wat02(_):- put_console(c#"*") | wat03.

wat03:- true | wat03(X), unify(X,[list]).
wat03(X):- wait(X), put_console(c#"d") | wat04.
